@startuml sequence_live_completion
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Outstanding Todos - Live invalidation on completion

actor User
participant "ToDos Page" as TP
participant "API" as API
participant "EventBus" as EB
participant "Notifier" as N
participant "SignalR" as SR
participant "Invalidations$" as IS
participant "Tile" as T
participant "Controller" as C

User -> TP: Mark todo complete
TP -> API: PATCH /todos/{id}
API -> EB: ToDoChangedEvent (Completed)
EB -> N: subscriber
N -> SR: dashboardTileDataInvalidated [outstandingTodos]
SR -> IS: emit
IS -> T: bindTileMode wakes
T -> C: load('live', null)
C -> API: GET /todos/outstanding-count
API --> C: { count: 3 }
C --> T: count signal updates
T --> User: Tile renders 3, LIVE pill

@enduml
